{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2023-05-25 08:00:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS BRINGS TOGETHER MULTIPLE BRANDS WITH INTRODUCTION OF COLUMBUS® HANDCRAFTED CHARCUTERIE BOARD', 'text': "WALMART EXCLUSIVE WILL FEATURE COLUMBUS® CRAFT MEATS, CORN NUTS® ORIGINAL AND JUSTIN'S® DARK CHOCOLATE PEANUT BUTTER CUPS ALONG WITH OTHER DELICIOUS FLAVORS TO ELEVATE THE CHARCUTERIE-BOARD BUILDING EXPERIENCE HAYWARD, CALIF. , MAY 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COLUMBUS® MANUFACTURING, MAKER OF PREMIUM, AWARD-WINNING ITALIAN DELI MEATS AND CHARCUTERIE FOR MORE THAN 100 YEARS, ANNOUNCES THE INTRODUCTION OF THE HANDCRAFTED CHARCUTERIE BOARD AVAILABLE EXCLUSIVELY AT WALMART."}